@startuml EntropyStatus
!include ../../style.puml
!include ./EntropyRequest.puml
!include ../commit-reveal/SignedCommitment.puml
!include ../commit-reveal/Reveal.puml

title EntropyStatus Struct

class EntropyStatus <<struct>> {
    + requestId: string
    + requestParams: EntropyRequest
    + commitments: Array<SignedCommitment>
    + reveals: Array<Reveal>
    --
    + calculateEntropy(): bytes32 | Error
}

EntropyStatus --> EntropyRequest : contains
EntropyStatus --> SignedCommitment : contains array
EntropyStatus --> Reveal : contains array

note right of EntropyStatus
  **EntropyStatus Struct**
  
  Complete status tracking for
  entropy generation request
  including all commitments,
  reveals, and calculation method.
end note

note bottom of EntropyStatus
  **Calculate Entropy**
  
  Method validates all timelock
  puzzles and combines reveals
  to generate final entropy
  or return validation errors.
end note

@enduml